One stylesheet per screen, loaded after components.css (issue-013 §7).

The files themselves belong to the screen that needs them, not to the asset
layer:

  dashboard.css         issue-017 (the dashboard)
  transactions.css      issue-018 (the transactions list)
  transaction-form.css  issue-018 (the add / edit form)
  reports.css           issue-019 (the reports)
  categories.css        issue-020 (the categories)
  settings.css          issue-020 (the settings)
  auth.css              issue-016 (the five guest screens)
  install.css           issue-015 (the install wizard)

A page stylesheet is OPTIONAL. A screen that needs no rules beyond the
component layer links none, and that is not a defect.
